# Simple Cube OBJ
o Cube

# Vertices (x, y, z)
v  1.0  1.0 -1.0
v  1.0 -1.0 -1.0
v -1.0 -1.0 -1.0
v -1.0  1.0 -1.0
v  1.0  1.0  1.0
v  1.0 -1.0  1.0
v -1.0 -1.0  1.0
v -1.0  1.0  1.0

# Faces (Each f line references 3 or 4 vertices to form a face)
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 8 7 6
f 1 5 6 2
f 2 6 7 3
f 3 7 8 4
f 5 1 4 8